<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - H.K. Telecom cut near-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - H.K. Telecom cut near-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it cut its rating on Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd to near-term neutral from buy, but maintained its long-term rating of accumulate on the stock.  </p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
